dsh-photocraft is an independent integration, not an official PhotoCraft or DeepSeek product.

PhotoCraft: https://github.com/storytold/photocraft
DeepSeek Harness: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

The PowerShell MCP bridge and validation scripts were adapted from the local
PhotoCraft integration. The MIT license notice is retained. No PhotoCraft
binaries, fonts, brand assets, user files, or credentials are distributed here.
The optional runtime installer downloads the original upstream portable archive
and preserves its bundled license files.
